  "instructions": [
    "Divide beef into 4 equal portions. Shape into patties slightly wider than the buns.",
    "Make a small indent in the center of each patty \u2014 prevents puffing.",
    "Season generously with salt and pepper on both sides.",
    "Cook on a hot grill or cast iron skillet 4-5 minutes per side for medium.",
    "Add cheese in the last minute. Cover to melt.",
    "Mix mayo, ketchup, and mustard for the burger sauce. Toast buns.",
    "Build burgers: bun, sauce, lettuce, patty, onion, pickles, top bun."
